=\"AeroCore Material Recovery\">\n    24→<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n    25→<meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Carbide, Tungsten & Aerospace Alloy Recovery | AeroCore\">\n    26→<meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"Competitive prices for carbide, tungsten, Inconel, titanium, and aerospace alloys. Fast quotes, any quantity.\">\n    27→<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/images/logo.png\" type=\"image/png\">\n    28→<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    29→<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    30→<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    31→<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/style.css\">\n    32→<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n    33→{\n    34→  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    35→  \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\",\n    36→  \"name\": \"AeroCore Material Recovery\",\n    37→  \"description\": \"High-performance material recovery company specializing in carbide, tungsten, aerospace alloys, and precision manufacturing materials.\",\n    38→  \"url\": \"https://areocore.com\",\n    39→  \"telephone\": \"+1-949-239-8912\",\n    40→  \"email\": \"Info@AreoCore.com\",\n    41→  \"address\": {\n    42→    \"@type\": \"PostalAddress\",\n    43→    \"addressRegion\": \"CA\",\n    44→    \"addressCountry\": \"US\"\n    45→  },\n    46→  \"areaServed\": [\n    47→    {\"@type\": \"State\", \"name\": \"California\"},\n    48→    {\"@type\": \"Country\", \"name\": \"United States\"}\n    49→  ],\n    50→  \"priceRange\": \"$$\",","timestamp":"2026-03-23T18:30:56.433Z","tool":"output","toolId":"toolu_01E3xpDSQ23F2Ygtbtu1ECWr"},{"role":"thinking","content":"Good, I have the full plan. Now I need to:\n1. Verify task 1.1 (logo optimization) is done\n2. Verify task 1.2 (UTM capture) is done\n3. Check status of task 1.3 (thank-you page)\n4. Then continue with remaining tasks\n\nLet me check all three in parallel.Let me check each task:\n\n1. **Task 1.1 (Logo optimization)**: The logo is 39KB (under 50KB target) — this was compressed from the original 256KB. So this is DONE.\n\n2. **Task 1.2 (UTM capture)**: No matches for UTM/urlParams/searchParams in main.js — this was NOT completed. Need to verify more carefully.\n\n3. **Task 1.3 (Thank-you page)**: Does NOT exist — needs to be created.\n\nWait, Michael said 1.1 and 1.2 were already completed. \n\nLet me check the git status to see if there are unstaged changes that might explain the discrepancy.OK so here's what I can see:\n\n**Task 1.1 (Logo optimization):** Logo is 39KB, under the 50KB target. The original is still there at 256KB. This is DONE.\n\n**Task 1.2 (UTM capture):** NOT done. main.js has no UTM parameter handling. Michael said it was done, but it's not in the code. I need to implement this.\n\n**Task 1.3 (Thank-you page):** NOT done. The directory doesn't exist.\n\nLet me also read the contact page to understand the form structure before implementing UTM capture and the thank-you redirect.\n\n\nNow I'm going to work through the remaining tasks in order—marking 1.1 as complete, then tackling the UTM capture implementation and thank-you page creation. Let me start by examining the contact form HTML to see how it's structured.Good, I have all the context I need. Let me now implement the tasks in order:\n\n1. Mark 1.1 as done in the plan\n2. Implement 1.2 (UTM capture in main.js)\n3. Create 1.3 (thank-you page)\n4. Implement 1.4 (testimonials)\n5. Then deploy (1.5)\n\nLet me track my progress and start implementing. I'll use TodoWrite to track tasks.\n\nLet me start implementing all three tasks. I'll do them in sequence since some build on each other.\n\n\nNow I'm tackling 1.2 first—I need to capture UTM parameters from the URL on page load, store them in sessionStorage for persistence across navigation, inject them as hidden form fields, and include them in the mailto body. For 1.3, I'll create a thank-you page with matching navigation and footer, display a confirmation message, fire the conversion event on load, and add a home link. I'll also need to modify the form submission to redirect to that thank-you page instead of just updating the button. Finally, I'll add testimonials to the homepage.","timestamp":"2026-03-23T18:31:08.140Z"},{"role":"system","content":"Using ToolSearch...","timestamp":"2026-03-23T18:31:08.154Z","tool":"ToolSearch","toolId":"toolu_01YKvhdx7qYu1HyXHLSq8N99"},{"role":"system","content":"[{\"type\":\"tool_reference\",\"tool_name\":\"TodoWrite\"}]","timestamp":"2026-03-23T18:31:08.241Z","tool":"output","toolId":"toolu_01YKvhdx7qYu1HyXHLSq8N99"},{"role":"system","content":"Updating task list","timestamp":"2026-03-23T18:31:17.378Z","tool":"TodoWrite","toolId":"toolu_01Ah8sBcm72eYe4cqdkZhcF7"},{"role":"system","content":"Todos have been modified successfully. Ensure that you continue to use the todo list to track your progress. Please proceed with the current tasks if applicable","timestamp":"2026-03-23T18:31:17.381Z","tool":"output","toolId":"toolu_01Ah8sBcm72eYe4cqdkZhcF7"},{"role":"system","content":"Editing /Volumes/T9 Drive 1/SERVER7-AEROCORE/aerocore-lab/instances/aerocore/frontend/public/js/main.js","timestamp":"2026-03-23T18:31:26.344Z","tool":"Edit","toolId":"toolu_012m78cVxGbkQ8MQfdEth9cY"},{"role":"system","content":"The file /Volumes/T9 Drive 1/SERVER7-AEROCORE/aerocore-lab/instances/aerocore/frontend/public/js/main.js has been updated successfully.","timestamp":"2026-03-23T18:31:26.390Z","tool":"output","toolId":"toolu_012m78cVxGbkQ8MQfdEth9cY"},{"role":"system","content":"Editing /Volumes/T9 Drive 1/SERVER7-AEROCORE/aerocore-lab/instances/aerocore/frontend/public/js/main.js","timestamp":"2026-03-23T18:31:35.104Z","tool":"Edit","toolId":"toolu_01PYbw52oxcymu74HmYrPHM2"},{"role":"system","content":"The file /Volumes/T9 Drive 1/SERVER7-AEROCORE/aerocore-lab/instances/aerocore/frontend/public/js/main.js has been update