shared plans, etc.\n\nI should be selective about what to commit:\n\n\n- Include all frontend changes (the ad tracking, UTM, landing pages, form backend, etc.)\n- Include aerocore-ads instance files (campaign plans, scripts, docs)\n- Include shared plans\n- Include the changes-from-ads-lab-agent changelogs\n- Skip .wrangler cache files (sensitive/ephemeral)\n- Skip session message files (ephemeral)\n- Skip .audit files\n- Skip files outside the aerocore-lab directory (../aerocore/, ../mcps/, ../genesis/ — actually genesis IS part of the repo)\n\nLet me check the repo root to understand the structure better.","timestamp":"2026-03-23T20:06:32.872Z"},{"role":"system","content":"$ cd \"/Volumes/T9 Drive 1/SERVER7-AEROCORE/aerocore-lab\" && git rev-parse --show-toplevel 2>&1","timestamp":"2026-03-23T20:06:32.975Z","tool":"Bash","toolId":"toolu_01FZVTozjiDQhGHbfdo7Ujfb"},{"role":"system","content":"/Volumes/T9 Drive 1/SERVER7-AEROCORE\nShell cwd was reset to /Volumes/T9 Drive 1/SERVER7-AEROCORE/aerocore-lab/instances/aerocore","timestamp":"2026-03-23T20:06:33.330Z","tool":"output","toolId":"toolu_01FZVTozjiDQhGHbfdo7Ujfb"},{"role":"system","content":"$ cat \"/Volumes/T9 Drive 1/SERVER7-AEROCORE/aerocore-lab/.gitignore\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"No .gitignore\"","timestamp":"2026-03-23T20:06:33.404Z","tool":"Bash","toolId":"toolu_01BLrsAgJcnSpzazfN9aLC6Y"},{"role":"system","content":"No .gitignore","timestamp":"2026-03-23T20:06:33.427Z","tool":"output","toolId":"toolu_01BLrsAgJcnSpzazfN9aLC6Y"},{"role":"system","content":"$ cat \"/Volumes/T9 Drive 1/SERVER7-AEROCORE/.gitignore\" 2>/dev/null || echo \"No .gitignore at repo root\"","timestamp":"2026-03-23T20:06:37.599Z","tool":"Bash","toolId":"toolu_01Do6Tm5KhZkQHX3RPuoqgUE"},{"role":"system","content":"# Logs\n*.log\nlogs/\n\n# OS files\n.DS_Store\nThumbs.db\n.Spotlight-V100/\n.fseventsd/\n.Trashes/\n.TemporaryItems/\n\n# Node\nnode_modules/\n\n# Environment\n.env\n.env.local","timestamp":"2026-03-23T20:06:37.630Z","tool":"output","toolId":"toolu_01Do6Tm5KhZkQHX3RPuoqgUE"},{"role":"thinking","content":"OK, there's a lot of changes. Let me think about what to include in the commit. Michael wants me to:\n1. Back up both instances (9210 aerocore and 9211 aerocore-ads)\n2. Commit changes to GitHub\n\nThe changes include:\n- Modified files (tracked): frontend pages with gtag tracking, logo optimization, main.js with UTM/form/conversion code, sessions, genesis template changes\n- Untracked files: aerocore-ads instance files, landing pages, thank-you page, functions, shared plans, etc.\n\nI should be selective about what to commit:\n\n\n- Include all frontend changes (the ad tracking, UTM, landing pages, form backend, etc.)\n- Include aerocore-ads instance files (campaign plans, scripts, docs)\n- Include shared plans\n- Include the changes-from-ads-lab-agent changelogs\n- Skip .wrangler cache files (sensitive/ephemeral)\n- Skip session message files (ephemeral)\n- Skip .audit files\n- Skip files outside the aerocore-lab directory (../aerocore/, ../mcps/, ../genesis/ — actually genesis IS part of the repo)\n\nLet me check the repo root to understand the structure better.The repo root is `/Volumes/T9 Drive 1/SERVER7-AEROCORE`. The .gitignore doesn't exclude .wrangler or session files, but I should be careful about what to include. Let me exclude:\n- .wrangler cache files (contain account IDs, ephemeral)\n- .audit files (operational logs)\n- Files outside aerocore-lab that aren't part of our work (../aerocore/, ../mcps/)\n\nActually, the `../aerocore/` and `../mcps/` are sibling directories to aerocore-lab within the SERVER7-AEROCORE repo. \n\nI should focus on what we actually worked on—the aerocore-lab changes and genesis updates—rather than guessing what Michael wants included. I'll stage the modified files in aerocore-lab, the new instance files for aerocore and aerocore-ads, and skip the ephemeral cache and session files.","timestamp":"2026-03-23T20:06:51.071Z"},{"role":"system","content":"$ 